# Public app URL

Client-facing links (eSign `/sign/{token}`, portal, unsubscribe, attorney case
URLs) must use `publicAppUrl()` from `lib/constants/business-contact.ts`.

- Override per environment with `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` (localhost in dev).
- **Live host:** `https://goldenpathway.vercel.app` (`DEFAULT_APP_URL`).
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` is only a second env override. Its fallback is the same
  `DEFAULT_APP_URL`. Keep `scripts/check-business-contact.ts` asserting that origin.

Never hardcode an origin in an email template, a route handler, or a migration.
There is exactly one fallback string; do not invent a second.

`pnpm check:business-contact` guards the default.
